# 📐 Engineering Drawing Repository

This repository contains course materials, lab work, and group presentation resources for the **Engineering Drawing** course.  
It highlights both manual drafting skills and modern design approaches using AutoCAD and simulation.

---

## 🎓 Course Information

- **Course Name:** Engineering Drawing  
- **Instructor:** Md Saif Uddin  
- **University:** Eastern University  
- **Department:** Computer Science & Engineering  

---

## 🧠 Learning Outcomes

During this course, the following concepts and skills were developed:

- ✏️ Manual sketching techniques in engineering drawing  
- 📏 Understanding **Orthographic Projections**  
- 🔷 Understanding **Isometric Views**  
- 💻 Practical experience with **AutoCAD software**  
- 🛠️ Familiarity with essential AutoCAD tools and commands  

---

## 📊 Group Presentation Project

### 🚦 Smart City Traffic Management System  
**Using AutoCAD and Simulation**

This project focuses on designing an intelligent traffic management system for smart cities, combining engineering drawing concepts with modern technologies like AI and simulation.

---

## 🔍 Project Overview

### 📌 Introduction
- Rapid growth of urban traffic  
- Need for intelligent and automated systems  
- Use of AI and simulation for better traffic control  

### ⚠️ Problem Statement
- Traffic congestion and delays  
- Inefficient manual signal systems  
- Delayed emergency response  
- Lack of proper monitoring leading to accidents  

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

- ✅ Reduce traffic congestion using adaptive signal timing  
- ✅ Improve road safety through real-time monitoring  
- ✅ Implement intelligent AI-based traffic control  
- ✅ Enable priority routing for emergency vehicles  
- ✅ Enhance monitoring using CCTV and drones  

---

## 🏗️ Engineering Drawing & AutoCAD Use

- Road layout planning and lane design  
- Signal and CCTV placement  
- Junction and traffic flow design  
- Visualization of smart traffic systems using **AutoCAD**  

---

## ⚙️ System Architecture (Concept)

- 📡 Sensors & cameras collect traffic data  
- 🧠 AI processes data in cloud systems  
- 🚥 Signals are controlled dynamically  
- 🚑 Emergency services are prioritized  
- 🚁 Drones provide real-time monitoring  

---

## 🤖 AI Traffic Simulation

- Vehicle detection and traffic density analysis  
- Adaptive signal control using AI  
